  "original_procedure": "Glovebox-charge Ni(cod)2, PCy3, CsF, 2‑methoxynaphthalene, and the boronic ester into an oven‑dried Schlenk flask. Under argon, add anhydrous toluene (50 mL), stir 10 min at room temperature (green). Heat to 125 °C and reflux 17 h (black). Cool, filter through Celite, wash with EtOAc (400 mL), concentrate/dry. Dissolve in CH2Cl2 (200 mL), adsorb onto silica (48 g), and purify by silica gel chromatography (hexane/CH2Cl2 gradient) to give methyl 4‑(naphthalen‑2‑yl)benzoate. [Paraphrased summary of Step B; see source URL for full text.]"
